id: string_reverse
category: basics
difficulty: 2
libs:
checker: exact
timeout: 10
--- prompt
Write an Objeck program that reverses the string "Objeck is fun" character by character (build the result yourself, do not rely on a library reverse) and prints the reversed string.
--- expected
nuf si kcejbO
--- reference
class StringReverse {
	function : Main(args : String[]) ~ Nil {
		text := "Objeck is fun";
		reversed := "";
		for(i := text->Size() - 1; i >= 0; i -= 1;) {
			reversed->Append(text->Get(i));
		};
		reversed->PrintLine();
	}
}
